WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
Why can't you come up with the reason?

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:06,160
The gift bag was sold by my landlord.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,520
That's what we got after a lot of effort.

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,440
Can I exchange it for a gift pack for the fourth-level door?

5
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,160
How dare you sell it?

6
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:13,920
I was wrong, brother

7
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:17,160
The landlord and I are willing to pay two gold coins and three silver coins

8
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,240
and five units of iron

9
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,200
compensate you for the loss of your life

10
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,040
That's all, brother

11
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:23,240
I'm just a helper

12
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,440
No permission to use resources

13
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,520
This is what I begged the deputy chief for.

14
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,720
It took him a long time before he was willing to come out

15
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:27,680
Money from selling gift bags

16
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,960
He used it all to upgrade the third-level door.

17
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,600
Take people out first

18
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,640
I'll give you today's salary

19
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,720
That Li Ziqiang, please squeeze it again.

20
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,440
Let’s see if I can exchange it for more book money.

21
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,600
When we get the money, we'll give it 50-50

22
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:41,560
ok boss

23
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,200
I'm going to squeeze him hard right now

24
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,200
Book gold for free whoring

25
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,640
Fifty-five points is also a bloody profit

26
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:47,200
If he really brings a gift bag

27
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,160
I need one more

28
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:49,400
Resources for upgrading level 4 gates

29
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:50,600
It's better now
